  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advocacy capacity strengthening for national, inter-territorial and regional SGs of RECOWA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Secretary Generals (SGs) of RECOWA seek to strengthen their capacity in advocacy to enable them not only execute the decisions of the bishops on various problems especially, good governance, climate change and social justice but also to be in better position to take the right actions when needed. The training will seek to equip the SGs with knowledge and skills in advocacy and boost their confidence to engage with various stakeholders. Subsequently, the training aims to impact the life of men, women and children in RECOWA communities through the advocacy of the SGs and Bishops against injustices and bad governance.</narrative>
  </description>
